## Session 2 - Phase 07 Advertisement Completion

### Date

2026-05-04

### Agent

Antigravity (Gemini)

### Prompt

Complete Phase 07 Produce Exactness to 100% — implement remaining gaps, fix bugs, add tests, advertise Produce, and update ledger/contract.

### Changes

#### Code Changes
- `jansu-sans-io/src/record/deflated.rs` — Added Snappy encode path (`snap::raw::Encoder`) to `into_record_data`, completing the full Kafka compression codec matrix (none, gzip, snappy, lz4, zstd).
- `jansu-service/src/stream.rs` — Fixed inverted frame-size comparison bug. Was: `maximum_frame_size > frame_length(size)` (rejected small frames, allowed oversized). Now: `frame_length(size) > maximum_frame_size`.
- `jansu-storage/src/service/produce.rs` — Added batch-size validation (`MAX_MESSAGE_BYTES = 1_048_588`) in `validate_batch`, rejecting oversized batches with `MessageTooLarge` before any storage mutation.
- `jansu-broker/src/service.rs` — Added `ProduceRequest::KEY` to `advertised_versions()` with range 0..=11.

#### Test Changes
- `jansu-storage/tests/produce_exactness.rs` — Added Snappy to compression matrix; added `oversized_record_is_rejected_without_append` and `acks_zero_is_valid_and_appends` tests. 16 tests total (was 14).
- `jansu-broker/tests/produce_exactness.rs` — Replaced `api_versions_do_not_advertise_produce` with `api_versions_advertises_produce_after_phase_07`; added `produce_acks_zero_real_storage_appends_but_suppresses_wire`. 5 tests total (was 4).
- `jansu-broker/tests/compatibility_contract.rs` — Updated `broker_route_stack_advertises_only_approved_versions` to expect Produce in advertised APIs. Added `ProduceRequest` import.

#### Ledger & Audit Changes
- `docs/compatibility/kafka-4.2-ledger.json` — API key 0 upgraded: `current_advertised_versions` and `approved_advertised_versions` set to `{min: 0, max: 11}`, `semantic_status` → `compatible`, `failure_modes` → `partial`, profiles updated to `green` for jansu-native/slatedb/compat-preview.
- `AUDIT.md` — `AUDIT-003` moved from `open` to `resolved`.

